      "writtenOn": "2021-12-06T23:22:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hey, fair enough!\n\nAlso, just to quell my own fears on the media_id field being an empty string-- The default string constructor is already being called and setting the media_id value to an empty string. If nothing is found to overwrite it then that\u0027s the value that sticks. It presumably ends somewhere in error, as \"\" is treated in a few places in device.cc as an empty/invalid value. Do this won\u0027t yield any different behavior than today.",
      "parentUuid": "9ee5e805_e99c955b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 362,
        "startChar": 0,
